{
 "about": "A match move between layouts: the same mark (`id: mark`) and title travel from one composition to the next across each transition with `carry`, so every shot is a different layout but the eye never loses the subject. Taste decision: vary scale and placement shot to shot, and let continuity come from the carried element rather than from repeating one centred lockup.",
